Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:06.54,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:00.80,0:00:06.54,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,GO MY WAY～♪　GO 前へ～♪\n頑張ってゆきましょう～♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.48,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:06.73,0:00:08.48,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,ふふふふふ…………
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.50,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:08.68,0:00:10.50,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,――ご機嫌だね。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.57,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:10.72,0:00:12.57,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,あ、手毬ちゃんだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:16.97,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:12.78,0:00:16.97,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,聞いたよ。歌うんだってね、\n『GO MY WAY!!』。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.47,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:17.16,0:00:18.47,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,うんっ！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:22.41,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:18.68,0:00:22.41,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,次のライブで歌う曲を、\n浮かれて口ずさむなんて。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.92,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:22.62,0:00:24.92,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,ちょっと子供っぽすぎるんじゃない？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:28.79,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:25.10,0:00:28.79,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,いいんですぅ～。\nいまだけは、子供っぽくても。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:32.16,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:28.98,0:00:32.16,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,この嬉しさを、\n歌に込めてるところなんだ。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:37.79,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:32.36,0:00:37.79,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,ふーん。まあ、その気持ちは……\nわからなくもないよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.52,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:37.99,0:00:39.52,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,アイドルだからね。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:44.29,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:39.72,0:00:44.29,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,だけど、あなたって……その曲が\nどういうものなのか、
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.38,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:44.49,0:00:46.38,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,本当にわかっているの？
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.72,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:46.58,0:00:47.72,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,もちろん。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.91,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:47.92,0:00:51.91,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,アイドルなら誰でもしってる、\nアイドルの歌、だよね。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.23,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:52.11,0:00:55.23,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,わかるよ、\n手毬ちゃんがなにを言いたいのか。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:59.68,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:55.42,0:00:59.68,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,花海佑芽に『GO MY WAY!!』を\n歌う資格があるのか、って。
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.69,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:00:59.87,0:01:01.69,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,心配してくれてるんでしょ？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.67,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:01.90,0:01:03.67,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,心配だよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:07.27,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:03.87,0:01:07.27,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,アイドルをリスペクトしていない\nアイドルに歌われたら、
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.47,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:07.46,0:01:09.47,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,曲がかわいそうだから。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.06,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:09.66,0:01:11.06,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,ひひ～♪
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:15.12,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:11.27,0:01:15.12,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,なに？　咲季みたいな笑い方して。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.21,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:15.41,0:01:17.21,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,一緒に来て！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.95,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:23.56,0:01:25.95,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,――どうだった？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:28.53,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:26.18,0:01:28.53,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,………………………………………………
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:32.39,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:28.75,0:01:32.39,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,――やるね。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:34.09,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:32.58,0:01:34.09,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,聞き惚れたよ。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.37,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:34.28,0:01:36.37,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,現地で観てみたくなった。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.75,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:36.56,0:01:39.75,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,アイドル・花海佑芽の\n『GO MY WAY!!』。
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.80,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:39.95,0:01:41.80,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,……！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.86,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:42.00,0:01:44.86,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,やったぁ～～～～～～～～～～～～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:49.88,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:45.08,0:01:49.88,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,あの手毬ちゃんに！！\n認めてもらえたぞ～～～～！！
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:54.46,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:50.08,0:01:54.46,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,うるっさいな。\nそんなに喜ぶようなこと？
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.66,0:02:00.41,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:01:54.66,0:02:00.41,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,ふっふっふ！　いまのあたしは――\nすべてのアイドルをリスペクト！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.30,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:00.60,0:02:03.30,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,実力のあるアイドルは特に！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.32,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:03.51,0:02:05.32,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,……あっそ。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:10.44,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:05.51,0:02:10.44,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,咲季の言ったとおりだ。\nとんだスロースターターだね。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:15.21,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:10.64,0:02:15.21,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,あ～あ。\n3年間、退屈しないですみそう。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.48,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:15.42,0:02:16.48,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,手毬ちゃん。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:17.83,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:16.67,0:02:17.83,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,なに？
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:19.57,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:18.04,0:02:19.57,Campus Common,佑芽,0,0,0,,歌で勝つ。
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:21.51,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,
Comment: 0,0:02:19.77,0:02:21.51,Campus Common,手毬,0,0,0,,やってみれば。
